# The website (anyplay-gg/web) on the cloud's host name: the landing page at the root, the sign-in
# and sign-up pages and the files they load. Every other path, the APIs and the older pages under
# /web included, stays with the cloud.
@website path / /sign-in /create /_next/* /icon.svg /favicon.ico
handle @website {
	reverse_proxy web:3000
}
